# Only the reviewed sources may reach the image. The patterns apply at every depth: a git-ignored file (a build
# output, an env file, a key) does not show in `git status`, yet would otherwise be sent to the builder.
aegis-control-plane
data
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
**/.env*
**/.git
**/secrets
**/certs
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.log
**/*.test
**/*.exe
**/*.syso
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
